<Layout title="Privacy Policy"><article class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">LINKSZN / PRIVACY</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Effective October 30, 2026.</p><h2>Information on this site</h2><p>LINKSZN is a public, static deals publication. We do not require an account, process payments, or ask for payment card information. This version does not use our own advertising pixels, analytics scripts, or tracking cookies.</p><h2>Hosting and external content</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process standard request information, including IP address, browser details, requested URLs, and timestamps, to deliver and secure the site. Product images loaded from external providers also send those providers ordinary request information.</p><h2>Affiliate links and retailer sites</h2><p>When you follow an outbound link, the retailer or affiliate network may use cookies or other identifiers to attribute a purchase under its own privacy policy. Their practices and controls apply on their services. LINKSZN does not receive your payment details from these purchases.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>If you email us, we receive the address and information you choose to send. We use it to respond, evaluate corrections, and maintain necessary correspondence. Please do not send passwords or payment details. Messages sent to our domain address are forwarded through Cloudflare Email Routing and handled through Fastmail and retained only as needed for those purposes and applicable obligations.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can avoid outbound links, adjust browser cookie controls, or contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of information you have sent us, subject to applicable exceptions. We do not sell contact messages or personal information. The site is intended for a general audience and does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p><h2>Contact and updates</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:linkszn@fastmail.com">linkszn@fastmail.com</a> with privacy questions. We will update this page and its effective date if our practices change.</p></article></Layout>
